**#5) Governance Flow (Human Root Authority)**

This is the platform’s non-negotiable safety model.

(Observe) -> (Analyze) -> (Propose) -> (Approve) -> (Apply) -> (Verify)

+-----------+   +-----------+   +-----------+   +-----------+   +---------+
| Agent /   |-> |  LAIRS    |-> |  Forge    |-> |  Human    |-> |  Apply  |
| Gate / AV |   | Reasoning |   | Proposal  |   | Master    |   | (reboot |
+-----------+   +-----------+   +-----------+   | Admin     |   | boundary)
                                                   +-----------+
                                                         |
                                                         v
                                               +-------------------+
                                               | Audit Evidence +  |
                                               | Rollback Path     |
                                               +-------------------+


Principle:

No autonomous system modification.
The system may detect, reason, and propose — but only a human may authorize change, and only through controlled staging with rollback.


